 SYK phosphorylates PLCG2 on Y753 and Y759, enhancing the activity of PLCG2 (Suzuki-Inoue et al. 2004).", "literatureReference": [{"dbId": 5607371, "displayName": "Phospholipase C?2 (PLC?2) is key component in Dectin-2 signaling pathway, mediating anti-fungal innate immune responses", "title": "Phospholipase C?2 (PLC?2) is key component in Dectin-2 signaling pathway, mediating anti-fungal innate immune responses", "journal": "J. Biol. Chem.", "pages": "43651-9", "pubMedIdentifier": 22041900, "volume": 286, "year": 2011, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/22041900", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}, 443435, {"dbId": 5607135, "displayName": "Requirement of phospholipase C-gamma2 (PLCgamma2) for Dectin-1-induced antigen presentation and induction of TH1/TH17 polarization", "title": "Requirement of phospholipase C-gamma2 (PLCgamma2) for Dectin-1-induced antigen presentation and induction of TH1/TH17 polarization", "journal": "Eur. J. Immunol.", "pages": "1369-78", "pubMedIdentifier": 19404984, "volume": 39, "year": 2009, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19404984", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}, 5607277], "className": "Summation", "schemaClass": "Summation"}], "reviewStatus": {"dbId": 9821382, "displayName": "five stars", "definition": "externally reviewed", "name": ["five stars"], "className": "ReviewStatus", "schemaClass": "ReviewStatus"}, "isChimeric": false, "category": "transition", "catalystActivity": [{"dbId": 5607711, "displayName": "protein tyrosine kinase activity of 1,3-beta-D-glucan:p-Y15-CLEC7A:SYK [plasma membrane]", "catalyzedEvent": [5607745], "physicalEntity": {"dbId": 5607685, "displayName": "1,3-beta-D-glucan:p-Y15-CLEC7A:SYK [plasma membrane]", "stId": "R-HSA-5607685", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-5607685.1", "maxDepth": 3, "name": ["1,3-beta-D-glucan:p-Y15-CLEC7A:SYK", "1,3-beta-D-glucan:p-Y15-Dectin-1:SYK"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "catalystActivit